            <div xml:id="d919">

                <pb facs="0862" n="758" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg758"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6518.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Consul at Ciudad
                        Porfirio Díaz.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-07T19:36:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1913—7.36 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram March 6. Inform Consul at Saltillo to protest in the most vigorous
                    manner against any interruption of telegrams from the Consulate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
